{"version":0.9,"diodeParts":[{"id":"dp_led","partNumber":"(generic indicator LED - type TBD)","manufacturer":"TBD","description":"Cluster warning indicator LED. Colour, package and forward current not yet chosen. Current limiting is an OPEN item - either the LED board carries its own resistors or the loom must."}],"connectors":[{"id":"cl_c11","label":"OEM cluster connector C11","width":390,"cavities":[{"id":"c2","designation":"2","signal":"Turn L (G-B) - flasher LH stub"},{"id":"c11","designation":"11","signal":"Turn R (G-Y) - flasher RH stub"},{"id":"c12","designation":"12","signal":"High beam (R-L) - body residual feed"}],"schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":90},"layoutPosition":{"x":0,"y":90}},{"id":"cl_c12","label":"OEM cluster connector C12","width":390,"cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"Park brake (R-G) - grounds via OEM P1 / B2"},{"id":"c8","designation":"8","signal":"Alt L (Y) - charge-lamp drive"},{"id":"c9","designation":"9","signal":"IG +12 (B-O) - charge LED anode side"}],"schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":300},"layoutPosition":{"x":0,"y":300}},{"id":"dm_csb_ls","label":"CSB-LS","width":210,"cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"ECUMaster CSB3 low-side output, L1-L4 - channel TBD (see ST185-A-ECU C10 cavities 23-26, and CAN 0x643), wired on ST185-A-ECU"}],"schematicPosition":{"x":900,"y":690},"layoutPosition":{"x":900,"y":690}}],"diodes":[{"id":"d_hb","partId":"dp_led","anodeOnRight":false,"schematicPosition":{"x":450,"y":90},"layoutPosition":{"x":450,"y":90}},{"id":"d_tl","partId":"dp_led","anodeOnRight":false,"schematicPosition":{"x":450,"y":210},"layoutPosition":{"x":450,"y":210}},{"id":"d_tr","partId":"dp_led","anodeOnRight":false,"schematicPosition":{"x":450,"y":330},"layoutPosition":{"x":450,"y":330}},{"id":"d_pk","partId":"dp_led","anodeOnRight":false,"schematicPosition":{"x":450,"y":450},"layoutPosition":{"x":450,"y":450}},{"id":"d_chg","partId":"dp_led","anodeOnRight":false,"schematicPosition":{"x":450,"y":570},"layoutPosition":{"x":450,"y":570}},{"id":"d_oil","partId":"dp_led","anodeOnRight":false,"schematicPosition":{"x":450,"y":690},"layoutPosition":{"x":450,"y":690}}],"splices":[{"id":"sp_led_gnd","schematicPosition":{"x":690,"y":210},"layoutPosition":{"x":690,"y":210}},{"id":"sp_led_12v","schematicPosition":{"x":240,"y":570},"layoutPosition":{"x":240,"y":570}}],"terminals":[{"id":"t_led_gnd","type":"Ring","width":210,"signal":"LED common return - DESTINATION NOT CONFIRMED (open item)","schematicPosition":{"x":900,"y":210},"layoutPosition":{"x":900,"y":210}},{"id":"t_led_12v","type":"Loose","width":210,"signal":"+12V IG to LED anodes - SOURCE PIN NOT IDENTIFIED (open item)","schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":570},"layoutPosition":{"x":0,"y":570}}],"wires":[{"id":"w_hb_a","color":"Red","source":{"id":"cl_c11","handle":"c12"},"target":{"id":"d_hb","handle":"Left"}},{"id":"w_hb_k","color":"Black","source":{"id":"d_hb","handle":"Right"},"target":{"id":"sp_led_gnd","handle":"Splice"}},{"id":"w_tl_a","color":"Green","source":{"id":"cl_c11","handle":"c2"},"target":{"id":"d_tl","handle":"Left"}},{"id":"w_tl_k","color":"Black","source":{"id":"d_tl","handle":"Right"},"target":{"id":"sp_led_gnd","handle":"Splice"}},{"id":"w_tr_a","color":"Green","source":{"id":"cl_c11","handle":"c11"},"target":{"id":"d_tr","handle":"Left"}},{"id":"w_tr_k","color":"Black","source":{"id":"d_tr","handle":"Right"},"target":{"id":"sp_led_gnd","handle":"Splice"}},{"id":"w_led_gnd_out","color":"Black","source":{"id":"sp_led_gnd","handle":"Splice"},"target":{"id":"t_led_gnd","handle":"Terminal"}},{"id":"w_12v_in","color":"Red","source":{"id":"t_led_12v","handle":"Terminal"},"target":{"id":"sp_led_12v","handle":"Splice"}},{"id":"w_pk_a","color":"Red","source":{"id":"sp_led_12v","handle":"Splice"},"target":{"id":"d_pk","handle":"Left"}},{"id":"w_pk_k","color":"Red","source":{"id":"d_pk","handle":"Right"},"target":{"id":"cl_c12","handle":"c1"},"stripeColor":"Green"},{"id":"w_chg_a","color":"Black","source":{"id":"cl_c12","handle":"c9"},"target":{"id":"d_chg","handle":"Left"},"stripeColor":"Orange"},{"id":"w_chg_k","color":"Yellow","source":{"id":"d_chg","handle":"Right"},"target":{"id":"cl_c12","handle":"c8"}},{"id":"w_oil_a","color":"Red","source":{"id":"sp_led_12v","handle":"Splice"},"target":{"id":"d_oil","handle":"Left"}},{"id":"w_oil_k","color":"White","source":{"id":"d_oil","handle":"Right"},"target":{"id":"dm_csb_ls","handle":"c1"}}],"schematicNotes":[{"id":"n_src","text":"ST185 cluster LED loom. A separate circuit from the cluster itself - warning and status indicators only. Migrated 2026-09-19 from docs/electrical/CLUSTER-LED-DIAGRAM.html, which was the only record of these connections.","width":390,"schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":-1180}},{"id":"n_stripe","text":"Stripe colours live in the cavity text - the schema colour list has no striped values. C11-2 G-B, C11-11 G-Y, C11-12 R-L, C12-1 R-G, C12-8 Y, C12-9 B-O.","width":390,"schematicPosition":{"x":420,"y":-1180}},{"id":"n_chg","text":"Charge LED is a series path: IG +12 (C12-9) to LED to alternator L (C12-8). ON when the regulator grounds L (not charging), OFF when L sits near battery volts. Alternator S is a battery sense line, NOT a lamp - do not wire it here.","width":390,"schematicPosition":{"x":840,"y":-1180}},{"id":"n_oil","text":"Oil LED is CAN-driven, no discrete sense wire. Link sets Low Oil Press 2 on 0x3F1 bit4; PCLink packs the CSB low-side on 0x643. The CSB sinks the cathode; the anode goes to +12 IG.","width":390,"schematicPosition":{"x":1260,"y":-1180}},{"id":"n_open","text":"STILL OPEN - do not build these two. 1) Where the LED common return actually lands. The three feed-side LEDs (high beam, turn L, turn R) are drawn joining at sp_led_gnd and running to t_led_gnd; a local chassis ground is the obvious answer but the source diagram does not say, so t_led_gnd has no destination yet. 2) The +12V IG anode feed for the park brake and oil LEDs - stated as existing, no pin given, drawn as t_led_12v. 3) Current limiting: whether the LED board carries its own resistors or the loom must. No resistors are drawn. Park brake grounds through the OEM P1 / B2 path, which is why its cathode goes to C12-1 and not to the common return.","width":390,"schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":-360}}]}